### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Generate a campaign package
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/campaigns/generate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Thread-ID: demo-thread-001

{
  "product": {
    "sku": "CUP-001",
    "name": "轻盈随行保温杯",
